--- !u!114 &-8030534297925312226
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>Emission and light.</b> An emissive surface is only bright itself: it does not light anything around it. The light that falls on the canopy and the ground comes from real Light components, placed beside the emissive surfaces in \xA7 9."
--- !u!114 &-7685994741456399628
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: '<b>The concrete materials.</b> <i>GS-Concrete-Curb</i> (curb, kiosk floor and step), <i>GS-Concrete-Wall</i> (kiosk walls), <i>GS-Concrete-Roof</i> (both roof tops). Base Map: the concrete albedo; Normal Map: the concrete normal; Metallic Map: the material''s own MetalSmooth map. Tiling around 0.5 to 0.8, so one tile covers 1.2 to 2 m.'
--- !u!114 &-7490572348709785319
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: <b>The metal materials.</b> <i>GS-Metal-Canopy</i> (fascia, soffit, ribs, fixture housings, sign pole), <i>GS-Metal-Column</i>, <i>GS-Metal-Pump</i>, <i>GS-Metal-Green</i> (bin, kiosk door). They use the rusted-metal maps. The canopy and column metals use a neutral grey copy of the albedo (<i>green_metal_rust_albedo_neutral.jpg</i>), tinted by the Base Color, so one texture gives several metals.
--- !u!114 &-6066103684802111240
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 1
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 935228c0fd2628c4db5028980babef0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: NarrativeParagraph
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Tutorials.Editor::Unity.Tutorials.Editor.Paragraphs.NarrativeParagraph
  m_MaskingSettings:
    m_MaskingEnabled: 0
    m_UnmaskedViews: []
    MaskPreset: {fileID: 0}
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "\u2022 <b><i>GS-Tube-Glass</i></b> \u2014 On: the fluorescent tubes \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 170, 230, 255 \xB7 Intensity: 2.9\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Lamp-Glass-Warm</i></b> \u2014 On: wall lamp glass, interior ceiling panel \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 255, 217, 162 \xB7 Intensity: 2.4\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Sodium-Glass</i></b> \u2014 On: street lamp heads \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 255, 195, 127 \xB7 Intensity: 2.0\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Glass-Window</i></b> \u2014 On: both kiosk windows \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 255, 188, 120 \xB7 Intensity: 0.5 \xB7 Emission Map: <i>Window-Glow.png</i> (brighter at the top)\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Fridge-Glow</i></b> \u2014 On: fridge front \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 224, 249, 255 \xB7 Intensity: 0.4\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Price-Sign</i></b> \u2014 On: sign face \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 255, 255, 255 \xB7 Intensity: \u22120.6 \xB7 Emission Map: <i>Price-Sign.png</i> (the prices)\n\u2022 <b><i>GS-Screen</i></b> \u2014 On: pump screens and price displays \xB7 Emission colour (0\u2013255): 191, 255, 236 \xB7 Intensity: \u22121.1"
